<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says Yandi capacity has risen.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says Yandi capacity has risen.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Tuesday that an expansion to its Yandi iron ore operation in Western Australia had boosted total capacity to 35 million tonnes per annum (mtpa).</p>
<p>BHP had originally forecast the expansion -- a second mine which opened last July -- would boost capacity to 25 mtpa, the company said.</p>
